      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "已打开详情页原文：Detail for Portfolios Formed on Earnings/Price Detail for Portfolios Formed on Market Beta Monthly Returns: July 1963 - July 2026 Annual Returns: 1964 - 2025 Portfolios: Market Beta quintiles; deciles. Construction: The portfolios are formed on univariate market beta (β) at the end of each June using NYSE breakpoints. β for June of year t is estimated using the preceding five years (two minimum) of past monthly returns. Stocks: All NYSE, AMEX, and NASDAQ stocks for which we have market equity data for June of t and good returns for the preceding 60 months (24 months minimum)."
